[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "色々話聞いてきたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've gathered lots of info!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そちらはどうだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How are things on your end?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一通りアイデア出しは終わって、\n今は過去に流行ったものを調べてます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've finished brainstorming ideas and now we're researching popular items from the past."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "流行ったもの……キューブがたくさんくっついていて、\nたくさん角がある消しゴムとかか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Popular items... Like those disassembling 3D puzzle erasers?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "芯が回ってずっととがってるシャーペンとか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Or those mechanical pencils where the lead keeps twisting out to stay sharp when you lift it from the paper?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと古いような気もするけど……\nうん、そういうのだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those might be a bit dated, but... yes, things like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実用性があるものがいいってことなんでしょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we should focus on practical items, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いい香りのする練り消しとかも流行りましたし、\n必ずしもそういうことではないと思いますが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Scented putty erasers were popular too, so I don't think practicality is always necessary..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実用性はあったほうがいいと思います。\nそうじゃないと、先生に没収されちゃうかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I do think it should be practical. Otherwise, the teachers might confiscate it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ、確かにな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, that's a fair point."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先生に見つからずに使える、わくわくする\nものがいいなあ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something exciting that students can use without teachers noticing would be perfect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見つからない……わくわく……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Without being noticed... that's exciting..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "思いついたかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think I've got something..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当！？\u3000どんなもの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?! What is it?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今から説明するから、作れそうかどうか教えてほしいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll explain it now. Could you tell me if it's something we could make?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "持って帰ってきた資料、どうだった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How did those documents we brought back look?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううむ……やはり教育機関。\nすでにだいぶコストが抑えられていますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... Educational institutions, indeed. They've already managed to keep costs quite low."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のものより価格を抑えるにしても、数コールっていう\n世界になってきそうですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if we try to lower the price from what's currently available, we're looking at a difference of just a few cole."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "であれば、付加価値を付けるしかないですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, we need to add value in other ways."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、次はそれを考えなくちゃか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So now we have to think about that, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、アイディアはすでにあります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, we already have ideas."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、そうなの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "問題は実現できるかどうか。\n皆さん、相談させてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The question is whether we can make them happen. I'd like to consult with all of you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんだよ。やりたいこと、なんでも言ってみて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! Tell us what you want to do!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こうして、私たちは実習で作るものを決め……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And so, we decided what to make for our practical exercise..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "採取に、調合に、発表準備にと大忙しの日々を\n送ることになるのでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Between gathering materials, synthesis, and preparing for the presentation, we found ourselves incredibly busy in the days that followed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]